[Artist: Lyrics & Music: Eve]

52
00:12:54,766 --> 00:13:00,786
繋がってたいって信じられる言葉だってもう昨日の僕らにさらば
Words like "I want to stay connected" and "I can believe"—farewell to yesterday's us.

53
00:13:01,246 --> 00:13:06,266
青い春を過ごした遠い稲妻
The distant lightning where we spent our blue spring days.

54
00:13:06,446 --> 00:13:13,366
ずっと泣いてばっかりじゃお前を向けたらきっとどんなに楽になれていただろうな
If I could only face you instead of crying all the time, how much easier it would have been.

55
00:13:13,626 --> 00:13:18,246
この心を揺らした一筋の望みは
The single ray of hope that shook this heart

56
00:13:18,626 --> 00:13:26,946
ないものねだりばっかもうやめた不完全人間らしく素晴らしい世界だけが答えを握ってる
I've stopped wishing for what I don't have; like the imperfect humans we are, only this wonderful world holds the answer.

57
00:13:30,986 --> 00:13:35,746
諦めてしまうほどこの先沢山の後悔が君を待ってるけども
Even though countless regrets await you ahead, enough to make you want to give up,

58
00:13:37,326 --> 00:13:42,566
もう迷いはしないよこの傷も愛しく思えてしまうほど
I won't hesitate anymore, to the point where even these scars feel precious.

59
00:13:43,126 --> 00:13:49,626
重なってしまうままでいいから走れ走れ
It's fine if they keep overlapping, so run, run!

60
00:13:50,106 --> 00:13:53,706
その歩幅で走れ心を動かして
Run with your stride, set your heart in motion!

61
00:13:54,166 --> 00:14:04,826
いつか痛みも同じくらい抱きしめてちっぽけな今を繋ぎ未来へ走れ
Someday, embrace the pain just as much, connect this tiny present and run toward the future!

62
00:14:16,646 --> 00:14:27,806
こんな名前もない僕たちがたった一つの歌をかき鳴らすいそらみたいな奇跡のような切なさと痛みだけが
Nameless people like us strumming a single song, like an azure sky—only a miraculous sorrow and pain remain.

63
00:14:28,426 --> 00:14:34,566
あっという間に流れる時が有りのままであり続ける怖さが
The time that flows in the blink of an eye, the fear of continuing to be just as we are,

64
00:14:35,346 --> 00:14:39,566
失った時間は取り戻せないけれど
We can't recover the time we've lost, but

65
00:14:40,066 --> 00:14:48,746
過去を振り返ってばかりじゃ痛だってんだ悔しさと痛みだけが
Constantly looking back at the past hurts—only frustration and pain

66
00:14:49,806 --> 00:14:57,066
君を肯定するからお隣になれたら忘れてしまうの
Affirm you, so if I become your neighbor, will I forget?

67
00:14:57,586 --> 00:15:05,006
君との約束をした場所はもうない覚えているよ
The place where we made our promise is gone, but I remember it.

68
00:15:05,855 --> 00:15:07,945
かみさまでさえ知らぬ間に
Before even God knew...

69
00:15:07,945 --> 00:15:11,365
深くのまれていいから
It's fine to be swallowed up deep down,

70
00:15:11,365 --> 00:15:15,535
その声はどこまで鳴り響いて
How far does that voice echo?

71
00:15:15,535 --> 00:15:19,905
確かだな理由を抱いてここまで来たんだ
Holding onto a certain reason, I came all this way.

72
00:15:19,905 --> 00:15:23,775
ああ まだ終わらない旅路なんだ
Ah, this journey is still not over.

73
00:15:23,775 --> 00:15:28,235
まだ終わらない旅路なんだ
It's a journey that's still not over.

74
00:15:28,635 --> 00:15:32,335
いつしか思いは形になる
Someday, feelings will take shape.

75
00:15:32,805 --> 00:15:36,205
この真っ白に染まる朝
In this morning dyed pure white,

76
00:15:36,505 --> 00:15:42,085
忘れられないままだから
Unable to forget it, so...

77
00:15:42,675 --> 00:15:47,985
諦めてしまうほどこの先たくさんの
So many things ahead that might make you want to give up,

78
00:15:48,485 --> 00:15:53,005
守れない迷いはしないよ
I won't harbor uncertainties I can't protect.

79
00:15:53,005 --> 00:15:57,265
かけがえのないもの溢れてしまうよ
Irreplaceable things will overflow.

80
00:15:57,265 --> 00:16:04,165
答えは君のその手の中に話さないで
The answer is right in your hands, don't let go.

81
00:16:04,165 --> 00:16:07,315
物語は一歩前へ
The story takes a step forward.

82
00:16:07,785 --> 00:16:16,615
諦めてしまうほどこの先たくさんの後悔が君を待ってるけどもう迷いはしないよ
So many regrets await you ahead, enough to make you want to give up, but I won't hesitate anymore.

83
00:16:16,785 --> 00:16:20,625
この傷も愛しく思えてしまうほど
So much so that even these scars feel precious,

84
00:16:20,625 --> 00:16:24,625
重ねてしまうよ 深くのまれていいから
they pile up... It's fine to be swallowed deep down,

85
00:16:24,625 --> 00:16:28,125
走れ その幅で
run with that stride!

86
00:16:28,125 --> 00:16:31,425
走れ これ以上遠ざけてくれ
Run, push it even further away.

87
00:16:32,124 --> 00:16:35,924
痛い感情を同じくらいだけ抱きしめて
Embrace those painful emotions just as much.

88
00:16:35,924 --> 00:16:39,324
切ない今をつむぐ未来描いて
Draw a future spinning this poignant present.

89
00:17:16,124 --> 00:17:18,824
って、そういえば自己紹介してなくね!?
Wait, come to think of it, didn't we forget to introduce ourselves!?

90
