268
00:45:22,902 --> 00:45:26,232
僕も同じように息をしていたい
I want to be breathing just like you.

269
00:45:33,299 --> 00:45:36,799
Oh yeah, yeah, ah-ha!

270
00:45:37,799 --> 00:45:44,299
君の一歩は僕より遠い 間違いなく君の凄いところ
Your step is farther than mine—without a doubt, that's your amazing side.

271
00:45:44,299 --> 00:45:50,799
足あとは僕の方が多い 間違いなく僕の凄いところ
My footprints are more numerous—without a doubt, that's my amazing side.

272
00:45:50,799 --> 00:45:57,299
真っ暗闇が怖いときは 怖さを比べふざけながらこう
When pitch-black darkness is scary, comparing our fears while joking around like this...

273
00:45:57,299 --> 00:46:03,799
太陽がなくても歩ける 君と照らす世界が見える
We can walk even without the sun; I can see a world illuminated with you.

274
00:46:03,799 --> 00:46:10,299
言えないこと 聞かないままで 消えない傷の意味知らないままで
Without hearing what can't be said, without knowing the meaning of scars that won't fade...

275
00:46:10,299 --> 00:46:17,799
でも目合えば笑えるのさ 涙を挟んでも 転んだら手を貸してもらうよりも
But if our eyes meet, we can smile, even holding back tears. Rather than having you lend a hand when I fall...

276
00:46:17,799 --> 00:46:23,799
優しい言葉選んでもらうよりも 隣で
Rather than having you choose gentle words... Right beside you,

277
00:46:23,799 --> 00:46:31,799
信じてほしいんだ どこまでも一緒に行けると ついにたどり着くその時
I want you to believe we can go together anywhere, until the moment we finally arrive.

278
00:46:34,799 --> 00:46:38,799
夢のショータイムに触れるとき
When touching the dream's showtime,

279
00:46:38,799 --> 00:46:45,799
必ず 一番そばで 君の目に映る景色にいたい
Always right by your side, I want to be in the scenery reflecting in your eyes.

280
00:46:57,799 --> 00:47:03,799
あの輝きを 君に会うから見えた
That radiance... I was able to see it because I met you.

281
00:47:03,799 --> 00:47:09,799
あの輝きを確かめにいこう Oh yeah!
Let's go confirm that radiance, oh yeah!

282
00:47:12,799 --> 00:47:16,299
どんな最後が待っていようとも
No matter what kind of ending awaits us,

283
00:47:16,299 --> 00:47:25,799
もう離せない手を繋いだよ 隣で隣で君のそばで 魂がこうないと叫ぶ
We held hands, unable to let go anymore. Right beside you, by your side, screaming that our souls...

284
00:47:25,799 --> 00:47:32,799
そして流星が光るとき 僕らを流星が抱きしめるとき
And when shooting stars shine, when shooting stars embrace us,

285
00:47:32,799 --> 00:47:39,799
誰より近くで特等席で 僕のみた君を君に伝えたい
From the closest seat, the best seat, I want to convey the you I saw to you.

286
00:47:39,799 --> 00:47:47,799
君がいることを君に伝えたい そうやって始まったんだよ
I want to tell you that you are here. That's how it all started.

287
00:47:57,799 --> 00:48:02,799
そうやって始まったんだよ
That's how it all started.

288
00:48:03,799 --> 00:48:07,799
Oh yeah, yeah, ah-ha!

289
00:48:21,810 --> 00:48:25,300
わあ！お母さんたちだ！
Wah! It's our moms!

290
00:48:25,300 --> 00:48:28,600
かなでちゃん、お誕生日おめでとう！
Kanade-chan, happy birthday!

291
00:48:29,299 --> 00:48:32,599
おめでとう！
Happy birthday!

292
00:48:32,599 --> 00:48:35,299
おめでとう！おめでとう！
Congratulations! Congratulations!

293
00:48:37,799 --> 00:48:41,799
そばが欲しいな...お前に言われたくねえよ！
I want some buckwheat noodles... Don't tell me that!

294
00:48:43,799 --> 00:48:47,299
かなでちゃんが一番おぎりきしてんだからね
Kanade-chan is the one who's making the biggest fuss, right?

295
00:48:47,299 --> 00:48:49,299
誕生日だから！
Because it's my birthday!

296
00:48:49,299 --> 00:48:51,799
お母さんたち生んでくれてありがとうございます！
Moms, thank you so much for giving birth to me!

297
00:48:51,799 --> 00:48:55,299
産んでない産んでない産んでない！
We didn't give birth to you! We didn't!

298
00:48:56,799 --> 00:48:59,299
こちらこそよ！どういうことだよ！
Same to you! What do you mean?!

299
00:49:03,799 --> 00:49:07,799
ママですけどね、産んでません。
We're your moms, but we didn't give birth to you.

300
00:49:08,299 --> 00:49:11,299
そして今日は何話すんですかここから？
And what are we talking about from here on?

301
00:49:11,299 --> 00:49:15,299
そうですね、えーと、これまでのコラボでの感想とか？
Let's see... uh, impressions from past collaborations and stuff?

302
00:49:15,299 --> 00:49:18,799
（もめたりとか...）大丈夫かな？
(Like arguments and...) Will that be okay?

303
00:49:21,799 --> 00:49:25,799
え、じゃあ一番印象深かったの何？かなでちゃんが。
Uh, then what left the strongest impression on you, Kanade-chan?

304
00:49:25,799 --> 00:49:29,299
そうだよ、気になる！でも、ゆうてこうママーズでやったコラボって...
That's right, I'm curious! But you know, out of the collabs we did as "Moms"...

305
00:49:29,299 --> 00:49:31,799
実は１個しかない！
There's actually only one!

306
00:49:33,299 --> 00:49:36,799
懐かしい！あんたんだ、あんたんだ！
Nostalgic! It was you, it was you!

307
00:49:37,799 --> 00:49:40,799
あれ、でもそういえば赤い髪の毛の人...
Oh, but come to think of it, that person with red hair...

308
00:49:40,799 --> 00:49:43,799
今日いなくない？
Isn't she here today?

309
00:49:43,799 --> 00:49:45,799
やっぱりあれじゃない？生んだとか言うから...
Could it be because of saying things like "giving birth"...?

310
00:49:48,799 --> 00:49:52,799
あでも、スケジュール的に、あ、そうなんだ！
Ah, but schedule-wise... Oh, is that so!

311
00:49:53,799 --> 00:49:57,799
ちょっと都合が合わなく...
Our schedules just didn't line up...

312
00:50:00,884 --> 00:50:04,744
次次ね、みんなできるといいね！コラボとかも、ね！
Next, next, I hope everyone can do it! Collaborations too, right!

313
00:50:05,204 --> 00:50:08,964
した！した！やった！やった！
We did it! We did it! Yay! Yay!

314
00:50:09,564 --> 00:50:12,284
なんかゲームコラボ以来ですからね。
It's been since our gaming collaboration, after all.

315
00:50:12,644 --> 00:50:14,504
そうだね！そうだね！うんうん。
That's right! That's right! Yeah, yeah.

316
00:50:15,644 --> 00:50:17,844
はい、えーっと、じゃあ次々次々！
Right, um, well then, next, next, next!

317
00:50:18,464 --> 00:50:21,364
いや、印象印象印象印象！
No, impressions, impressions, impressions!

318
00:50:21,464 --> 00:50:22,704
そうだ！そうだ！えっと…
That's right! That's right! Um...

319
00:50:23,204 --> 00:50:27,004
そうですね、印象の変化から言っていきますと、
That's right, if we talk about how our impressions changed,

320
00:50:27,344 --> 00:50:30,284
まず、スバルまんまわ…あ、これスバルちゃんが言うんだ！
first, Subaru is just... Ah, Subaru-chan is supposed to say this!

321
00:50:30,604 --> 00:50:33,884
なんでかなでちゃんが言っちゃうの！印象！
Why are you saying it, Kanade-chan! Impressions!

322
00:50:34,224 --> 00:50:37,464
そっちか！そうだ！あははは！
Oh, that way! That's right! Ah哈哈哈!

323
00:50:38,464 --> 00:50:40,924
え、じゃあ聴きたい聴きたい聴きたい！どっちから言う？
Eh, then I want to hear it! Which one goes first?

324
00:50:41,464 --> 00:50:44,164
え、どっちにしようかな。チャメいつもって、こっち！
Uh, which one should we do. Chame always, this way!

325
00:50:45,464 --> 00:50:47,764
じゃあ、スバルちゃんから、はい！
Then, from Subaru-chan, yes!

326
00:50:48,464 --> 00:50:50,564
こっちはスバルなんだ。かなでわ、最初は…
This one is Subaru. Kanade, at first...

327
00:50:52,464 --> 00:50:57,464
なんかアークで騒いるの見て、なんだこいつと思って。
I saw you making a ruckus in ARK and thought, "What is this guy?"

328
00:50:58,464 --> 00:51:05,564
そのアークで声が貫通してる頃からは、かなでは大丈夫なんだなっていう…
From back when your voice was carrying through ARK, I thought Kanade would be fine...

329
00:51:06,464 --> 00:51:10,964
大丈夫なんだなっていう…なんか元気さががあったんですよ、でもね！
That she'd be fine... There was a certain liveliness to you, but you know!

330
00:51:11,464 --> 00:51:19,864
GTL最後ね、かなでちゃんが手錠したなもうその顔やめろや！近いねん！
At the end of GTL, when Kanade-chan got cuffed, stop making that face! You're too close!

331
00:51:21,464 --> 00:51:26,564
なんかそのあとかなでちゃん実はね、私もっと頑張りたいです、とかね！
And then after that, Kanade-chan actually said things like, "I want to work harder," and stuff!

332
00:51:27,464 --> 00:51:29,364
電話してきたりとかね！
Like calling me up and all!

333
00:51:29,464 --> 00:51:31,464
それ言っちゃう！
You're saying that?!

334
00:51:31,964 --> 00:51:35,364
頑張り屋サンなんだなって思った！おめでとう！おめでとう！
I thought you were a hard worker! Congratulations! Congratulations!

335
00:51:36,464 --> 00:51:38,564
そして次、次！
And next, next!

336
00:51:39,464 --> 00:51:46,964
かなでちゃんはね、最初デビューした時さ、すごい歌もうまくてね、団長とは別世界の人間なんだなと思って全然絡めなかったけど…
Kanade-chan, when she first debuted, her singing was so good, and I thought she was a person from a completely different world from me, so I couldn't really interact with her much...

337
00:51:49,464 --> 00:52:00,564
やでもね、あのマイクらでね、覚えてる、あのダイヤをね、団長から嘘ついてね、盗ったりとかさ、そこから、あ、この子はそういう子なんだと…
But you know, remember in Minecraft, you lied to Dancho and stole diamonds, and from then on, I realized, "Oh, so this is the kind of kid she is..."

338
00:52:01,464 --> 00:52:05,564
結構ダイヤ、ダイヤ嘘ついて盗むようなやつ…
Stealing diamonds by lying...

339
00:52:06,464 --> 00:52:14,564
いや違うの！こんなね団長にもこうやって、そう、あのモノ申しせずね、絡んで来てくれたりも本当にかわいいの！
No, wait! Even to Dancho, she interacts without holding back like this, and it's really cute!

340
00:52:15,464 --> 00:52:19,964
いやだってね、ノエルままだったら何でも許してくれるって…
Well, because if it's Noel-mama, she forgives anything...

341
00:52:20,464 --> 00:52:22,564
もう許してんじゃん！
You're already forgiving her!

342
00:52:23,464 --> 00:52:26,564
だから、今ではね、どうそ後ろ行くのやめて！
So, nowadays, please stop going to the back!

343
00:52:27,464 --> 00:52:32,564
今ではね本当にいい子です、や！いい子！頑張って買った！
Nowadays she's really a good girl, yeah! A good girl! She worked hard and bought it!

344
00:52:33,464 --> 00:52:37,564
はい、でも本当に誕生日おめでとうね、かなちゃん！おめでとう！来てくれてありがとうございます！
Yes, but truly happy birthday, Kana-chan! Congratulations! Thank you for coming!

345
00:52:38,464 --> 00:52:44,564
一緒にに出られて本当に嬉しかった！ね！スバルたちもうれしかったぞ！
I was so really happy to appear together! Right! Subaru and the others were so happy too!

346
00:52:45,464 --> 00:52:49,564
え、どういう…いちゃいちゃすんな！
Eh, what is this... Stop acting all cozy!

347
00:52:50,464 --> 00:52:54,564
じゃ、はい！かなで次々！次が！
Well, yes! Kanade, next, next! The next one is!

348
00:52:55,464 --> 00:52:59,564
めっちゃ台本読む！お前だよ！お前がちゃんとしろよ！
Reading the script hard! It's you! You be proper!

349
00:53:00,464 --> 00:53:03,564
スバルままだ、ノエルままだ、そのあとかなでがなんと…
Subaru-mama, Noel-mama, and after that Kanade will...

350
00:53:04,464 --> 00:53:13,564
生パフォーマンスで一人で頑張るの！ええー！すごく、フリしてもらってもいいですか？いいよ！やったー！
perform live all by herself! Eeh?! Is it okay if I have you do the intro? Sure! Yay!

351
00:53:15,597 --> 00:53:19,897
次の曲は、ビューティフル！
The next song is Beautiful!

352
00:53:48,447 --> 00:53:51,447
[Title: Beautiful]

353
00:54:06,964 --> 00:54:12,564
曇り空のビル影 夜の波が消した
Under the cloudy sky's building shadows, the night's waves erased

354
00:54:12,564 --> 00:54:19,564
涙を流したなんて 気付かれないまま
the tears I shed, without anyone noticing,

355
00:54:20,364 --> 00:54:26,764
心を捨てるなら 傷つく方がマシさ
If I were to throw away my heart, getting hurt would be better.

356
00:54:26,964 --> 00:54:33,864
冷たい風を切って 逃げるように走る
Cutting through the cold wind, I run as if to escape.

357
00:54:34,264 --> 00:54:40,364
いつかこの雫は 宝石になるのだろう
Someday these droplets will surely become jewels.

358
00:54:40,464 --> 00:54:48,364
美しい心に 生まれ変わるとそう信じて
Believing so, that I will be reborn with a beautiful heart.

359
00:54:48,764 --> 00:54:56,164
世界で一つの 輝く光になれ
Become the one and only shining light in this world!

360
00:54:56,364 --> 00:55:01,964
私でいい 私を信じてゆくのさ
It's fine for it to be me, I will go on believing in myself!

361
00:55:02,322 --> 00:55:06,302
いつの日も かなしみの先に
No matter the day, beyond the sadness...

362
00:55:06,302 --> 00:55:12,702
孤独が押し寄せても 息をしてる
Even when loneliness washes over me, I'm breathing.

363
00:55:12,702 --> 00:55:17,402
今日も息をして生きているのさ
Breathing today, continuing to live on.

364
00:55:21,402 --> 00:55:31,702
誰かの「うらやましい」は 避けられない心臓
Someone else's envy is an unavoidable heartbeat.

365
00:55:31,702 --> 00:55:39,402
誰かを許すのは 難しい心臓は ないものを探せば
Forgiving someone is difficult; if I search for what I lack...

366
00:55:39,402 --> 00:55:48,702
数えきれないけれど ゆっくり愛してみよう 私という黒い命を
Though I can't count them all, let's try to love this black life of mine.

367
00:55:50,002 --> 00:55:54,702
世界で一つの 輝く光になれ
Become the one and only shining light in the world.

368
00:55:54,702 --> 00:56:02,202
明かりのない明日を迎えたとしても 悲しみの先に
Even if tomorrow comes without light, beyond the sadness...

369
00:56:02,202 --> 00:56:07,702
孤独が押し寄せても 息をしてる
Even when loneliness washes over, I'm breathing.

370
00:56:10,202 --> 00:56:18,202
今日も息をして 生きている
Breathing today, and living on.

371
00:56:42,202 --> 00:56:53,702
世界で一つの 輝く光になれ 私に幸あれ
Become the one and only shining light in the world. Blessings be upon me.

372
00:56:55,202 --> 00:57:06,702
涙に幸あれ 明日に幸あれ 明日に幸あれ
Blessings upon the tears, blessings upon tomorrow.

373
00:57:09,002 --> 00:57:18,702
世界で一つの 輝く光になれ 泣いてもいい
Become the one and only shining light in the world. It's okay to cry.

374
00:57:20,202 --> 00:57:28,702
私を歩いていくのさ 涙はほら 流れる星のようさ
I'll walk as myself. Tears are like falling stars.

375
00:57:30,002 --> 00:57:37,702
私になれ 私を抱えて生きていくのさ
Become yourself, embrace yourself and live on.

376
00:57:40,702 --> 00:57:57,702
いつの日も 涙に幸あれ 明日に幸あれ
No matter the day... blessings upon the tears, blessings upon tomorrow.

377
00:58:07,702 --> 00:58:16,202
世界で一つの 輝く光になれ
Become the one and only shining light in the world.

378
00:58:42,322 --> 00:58:47,052
はい、という形でお送りいたしましたでしょうか、ちょっとお水だけ飲んできます。
Yes, how was that? I'm just going to go drink some water.

379
00:58:57,402 --> 00:58:58,702
水上は…
Water...

380
00:58:59,212 --> 00:59:08,522
えー、この素晴らしい曲の余韻が消えぬ間に最後の曲聴いてください。はい！
Um, while the afterglow of this wonderful song hasn't faded yet, please listen to the final song. Yes!

381
00:59:16,452 --> 00:59:21,202
目を開けて 口ずさむ 輝ける
Open your eyes, hum along, shining on.

382
00:59:21,702 --> 00:59:27,302
きっとなれる
I'll surely become...

383
00:59:28,902 --> 00:59:30,702
[Text: feel my heart]

384
00:59:30,702 --> 00:59:32,702
[Text: See me become the GREATEST]

385
00:59:33,202 --> 00:59:36,202
[Text: No one can beat me]

386
00:59:36,202 --> 00:59:38,202
[Text: Cuz i'm a GREATEST]

387
00:59:39,702 --> 00:59:44,202
固く結び直した靴紐が 羽に見えて
The shoelaces I retied tightly looked like wings,

388
00:59:44,202 --> 00:59:48,202
どこまででも跳べる 予感がする
Giving me a feeling I can fly anywhere.

389
00:59:49,202 --> 00:59:54,202
追いかけるなんて趣味じゃない 追い越そう 明日だって
Chasing after things isn't my hobby, let's overtake even tomorrow.

390
00:59:54,702 --> 00:59:59,002
夢のまま終わるほど眠くないわ
I'm not sleepy enough to let it end as just a dream.

391
01:00:00,938 --> 01:00:02,498
何もかも大丈夫
Everything is going to be alright.

392
01:00:02,658 --> 01:00:05,498
奇跡よりも大胆に勝つの
Winning boldly beats any miracle.

393
01:00:05,498 --> 01:00:07,938
見たことない景色だって
Even scenery we've never seen before

394
01:00:07,938 --> 01:00:12,138
光に満ちていく
fills up with light.

395
01:00:12,638 --> 01:00:15,158
Wanna be the GREATEST!

396
01:00:15,158 --> 01:00:18,138
地図ならばこの胸に
If there's a map, it's right in this heart,

397
01:00:18,138 --> 01:00:20,678
あとは走る熱がある
with the passion to keep running ahead.

398
01:00:20,678 --> 01:00:23,478
誰も止められない my way
Nobody can stop my way.

399
01:00:23,538 --> 01:00:25,598
Wanna be the GREATEST!

400
01:00:25,598 --> 01:00:29,538
弱音も重ねればシンフォニー
Even frail voices, when piled up, become a symphony,

401
01:00:29,538 --> 01:00:33,978
強く慣れる歌って
singing a song to grow stronger—

402
01:00:33,978 --> 01:00:40,523
“きっ と無敵になる” (Feel my light)
"We will surely become invincible." (Feel my light)

403
01:00:44,439 --> 01:00:47,859
部屋で一人描いたステージも
Even the stage I pictured all alone in my room,

404
01:00:47,859 --> 01:00:50,579
覚えていて 居場所になる
remembered, becomes a place where I belong.

405
01:00:50,579 --> 01:00:53,559
声が聞こえてくる
Voices are starting to reach me.

406
01:00:54,219 --> 01:00:58,979
深呼吸をして 飛び乗るくらいが正攻法だって
Taking a deep breath, going all-in was the right path,

407
01:00:58,979 --> 01:01:03,879
胸を張って踊るのも悪くないわ
so standing tall and dancing isn't bad at all!

408
01:01:04,479 --> 01:01:07,159
恐れないで 大丈夫
Don't be afraid, it's going to be alright.

409
01:01:07,159 --> 01:01:10,439
唱えるたび 絶対になるの
Every time I chant it, it's bound to come true.

410
01:01:10,439 --> 01:01:15,179
一度きりの人生だって この手で舵を取れ
In this once-in-a-lifetime journey, take the helm with your own hands!

411
01:01:17,419 --> 01:01:19,979
Wanna be the GREATEST!

412
01:01:19,979 --> 01:01:24,999
私が私として 輝ける道を行く
I will walk the path where I can shine as myself.

413
01:01:24,999 --> 01:01:27,979
声もきらめいて my day
My voice sparkles too, my day!

414
01:01:28,339 --> 01:01:30,539
Wanna be the GREATEST!

415
01:01:30,539 --> 01:01:37,159
目覚めを奏でて オーバーチュアを望むほどに叶って
Playing the awakening, as much as you hope, it comes true—

416
01:01:37,159 --> 01:01:43,959
もっと素敵になる (Feel my light)
becoming even more wonderful! (Feel my light)

417
01:02:05,679 --> 01:02:10,099
[Feel my heart] [See me become the GREATEST]

418
01:02:10,099 --> 01:02:14,439
[No one can beat me] [Cuz I'm a GREATEST]

419
01:02:15,539 --> 01:02:17,999
Wanna be the GREATEST!

420
01:02:17,999 --> 01:02:20,519
諦めた「好き」の数
The number of things I gave up on loving,

421
01:02:20,519 --> 01:02:23,119
上を向く理由がある
give me a reason to look up.

422
01:02:23,119 --> 01:02:26,119
涙導いて my beat
Guiding my tears, my beat!

423
01:02:26,519 --> 01:02:28,719
Wanna be the GREATEST!

424
01:02:28,719 --> 01:02:31,459
傷跡も連れてアレグロ
Taking even my scars along, allegro!

425
01:02:31,459 --> 01:02:35,859
強く慣れる歌って
Singing a song to grow stronger,

426
01:02:35,859 --> 01:02:42,359
もっと光さす方へ
toward an even more radiant place—

427
01:02:42,359 --> 01:02:47,899
“きっ と無敵になる” (Feel my light)
"We will surely become invincible." (Feel my light)

428
01:02:58,637 --> 01:03:00,797
はぁ、という事で！
Haah, so anyways!

429
01:03:01,897 --> 01:03:06,517
今聴いていただいたのが、え、違う、聴いていただいていたのが
The song you just listened to—uh, no, the song you were just listening to—

430
01:03:06,517 --> 01:03:18,017
もう完全に力が抜けちゃいまして安心していま聴いていただいたのがなんと、初のオリジナル曲「GREATEST」です！
I was already completely drained of strength and relieved, and the song you just listened to was, surprise, my very first original song, "GREATEST"!

431
01:03:18,477 --> 01:03:22,637
ふぅー！すごい！ジャケットが、
Woohoo! Amazing! The jacket illustration...

432
01:03:22,637 --> 01:03:30,357
え、作詞作曲はナナホシ管弦楽団さん、あ、違う、管弦楽団さんです！
Oh, wait, the lyrics and composition are by Nanamori-chu Kangan Gakudan—ah, no, Nanamori-chu Kangan Gakudan!

433
01:03:30,537 --> 01:04:00,697
そしてこちらの楽曲、どういう楽曲かというと、すごく、言うと、こう、簡単に言うと、韓国から夢を来いに来たカナデなりのこう、「キラキラソング」「キラキラソング」みたいな感じになっていまして、カナデがこういうのを信じてやっていきたいんだみたいなのを伝えて書いていただきました。
And as for what kind of song this is, to put it simply, it's like a sparkling song that suits Kanade coming all the way from Korea to fulfill her dreams, and she wrote it to convey her belief in pursuing things like this.

434
01:04:00,697 --> 01:04:02,677
すごい、なんて素敵な歌詞を…
Wow, what wonderful lyrics...

435
01:04:02,677 --> 01:04:04,477
本当に素敵な曲と歌詞をありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for such a wonderful song and lyrics!

436
01:04:04,477 --> 01:04:05,517
めちゃ気に入ってます！
I love it so much!

437
01:04:05,517 --> 01:04:17,797
そして、4月21日0時から、この後およそ3時間後に楽曲リリースされます！イェーイ！ぱちぱち！ありがとうございます！最高すぎでしょ！ありがとうございます！
And starting April 21st at midnight, roughly 3 hours from now, the song will be released! Yay! Yay! Thank you so much! Isn't this just the best?! Thank you so much!

438
01:04:18,457 --> 01:04:24,977
MVもね、ちょっと後日公開なんですけれども、ぜひ公開されたらいっぱい見てください！
The MV will also be released a bit later on, so please be sure to watch it a lot once it's out!

439
01:04:24,977 --> 01:04:34,977
はい！新曲の披露もできたところで、告知タイムです！まず1つ目は、皆さんお待ちかね、グッズの紹介です！
