And next, this! Body's squishy-squishy cushion! Well, whatever, it's a face cushion with a sleeping expression! It says in the script to squish body's cheeks and give praise, but I don't remember giving permission! It's not squishy!

449
01:06:11,434 --> 01:06:25,954
